{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Transcend Timer 是一款專為不間斷冥想練習而設的計時器，透過溫和的引導讓你以平靜狀態開始和結束每節冥想。它適合希望保持專注、不受打擾的冥想用家，現正限時免費，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n\n<h2>三階段冥想引導</h2>\n<p>App 以三個自然階段組成：Warm Up 讓思緒沉澱，Meditation 是預設 20 分鐘的主體練習，Cool Down 則溫柔地帶你回到日常。各階段會自動接續，轉換過程安靜流暢；完成後更會自動記錄至 Apple Health，同時支援螢幕長亮、調低亮度及背景運作。全程毋須帳戶、網絡或追蹤。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-335-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-336-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-337-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-338-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-339-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1284x2778bb-340-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Transcend Timer</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-10T00:57:49.339632+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}